to closing being satisfied or waived, the closing of the purchase and sale of the Units (the &ldquo;<U>Closing</U>&rdquo;) shall take
place remotely through the exchange of signature pages and documents electronically on the day when all closing conditions are satisfied
or waived (the &ldquo;<U>Closing Date</U>&rdquo;).</P>

