purposes of this Agreement, &ldquo;Material Adverse Effect&rdquo; shall mean (i) any material adverse effect upon the assets, properties,
financial condition, business or prospects of the Company, and its Subsidiaries, when taken as a consolidated whole, and/or (ii) any condition,
