<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 3.9 <U>Use of Proceeds.</U>
The Company shall use the net proceeds from the sale of the Units hereunder for working capital and general corporate purposes and shall
not use such proceeds: (a) for the redemption of any Ordinary Shares or Ordinary Shares Equivalents, or (b) in violation of FCPA or OFAC
regulations.</P>

