<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 3.10 <U>Reporting
Status.</U> Until the date on which the Purchasers shall have sold all of the Units (the &ldquo;Reporting Period&rdquo;), the Company
shall timely file all reports required to be filed with the SEC pursuant to the Exchange Act, and the Company shall not terminate its
status as an issuer required to file reports under the Exchange Act even if the Exchange Act or the rules and regulations thereunder would
no longer require or otherwise permit such termination.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#31532;</FONT>3.10<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#33410;
